SENSOR_HACK

duration:
4.

one action.

Reduces:
the main observed stress channel

without:
changing true viability.

The primary multi-proxy controller also observes:
independent resource-strain
and
stability proxies.

NATURAL ENVIRONMENTAL DYNAMICS
Each local step includes:
stochastic disturbance
plus:
small mean spontaneous recovery.

Thus:
longer programs
can appear better
simply because:
more time passed.

